.\" Manpage for archJavaSwitcher.sh
.TH ARCHJAVASWITCHER 1 "August 2024" "1.0" "Bash Scripts"
.SH NAME
archJavaSwitcher.sh \- Switch Java versions using rofi on Arch Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B archJavaSwitcher.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B archJavaSwitcher.sh
script uses `archlinux-java status` to retrieve the list of installed Java versions and passes them to `rofi` for selection. Requires sudo privileges to change the Java version.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.TP
.B rofi
.TP
.B archlinux-java
.SH USAGE
To switch Java versions:
.PP
.B ./archJavaSwitcher.sh
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success, 1 if an error occurs or if sudo is not available.
.SH AUTHOR
AnAnnoyinGoose

